            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Hạ Long - Mai Ve Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Hue Smile Travel - Tour Organizer\nHue, Vietnam27 contributions\n2\nNice Seafood Resraurant in Ha Long\nMay 2025 • Family\nI had a wonderful dinner with my family at Mai Về Restaurant in Ha Long. The space is wide and very clean, making it comfortable for both small and large groups. The food was incredibly fresh and delicious – especially the Sam dish, which was the highlight of our meal. Prices were quite reasonable considering the quality and service. Overall, we were very satisfied and would definitely recommend this place to anyone visiting Ha Long\nRead more\nWritten May 18, 2025\nHa Long - Mai Ve Restaurant\nThank you @Huesmiletraveloffice\n for your wonderful support of Nhà Hàng Hạ Long Mai Về! We’re thrilled your family enjoyed a delightful dinner with our spacious, clean ambiance and fresh, delicious Ha Long Seafood Combo, especially the Sam dish that stood out. We’re glad you found our prices reasonable and appreciated the quality service! We look forward to welcoming you back.\nThe Team at Nhà Hàng Hạ Long - Mai Về Restaurant \nSincerely,\nThe Team at Nhà Hàng Hạ Long - Mai Về Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten May 19, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
